# A Warband game, written down move by move.
#
# Lines that are not comments are commands, exactly as they are typed at the
# prompt. Undo and redo are moves like any other, so reading this file back
# retraces the game as it was really played - second thoughts and all - and
# arrives at the same position it was saved from.
#
# The deal line says how many were playing, what they were dealt from, and who
# was in each seat - 'you' for a person here, a skill for the program. The format
# line above it is the shape of the file itself, so a later engine reading this
# one knows what it is looking at.
#
#   dotnet run -- warband replay <this file>

format 1
deal 2 639231258993610147 you you

#   1  turn 0, Squad One
run
#      The battle is stopped. 'step' takes it a blow at a time.

#   2  turn 1, Squad One
run
#      The battle runs on.

#   3  turn 2, Squad One
muster spearman m1
#      Squad One musters a spearman at m1.

#   4  turn 3, Squad Two
run
#      The battle is stopped. 'step' takes it a blow at a time.

#   5  turn 4, Squad Two
muster bowman b3
#      Squad Two musters a bowman at b3.

#   6  turn 5, Squad One
muster mender m2
#      Squad One musters a mender at m2.

#   7  turn 6, Squad Two
muster bowman b1
#      Squad Two musters a bowman at b1.

#   8  turn 7, Squad One
muster warder f1
#      Squad One musters a warder at f1.

#   9  turn 8, Squad Two
muster footman f1
#      Squad Two musters a footman at f1.

#  10  turn 9, Squad One
muster rider f3
#      Squad One musters a rider at f3.

#  11  turn 10, Squad Two
muster footman f3
#      Squad Two musters a footman at f3.

#  12  turn 11, Squad One
muster footman b3
#      Squad One musters a footman at b3.

#  13  turn 12, Squad Two
muster rider m2
#      Squad Two musters a rider at m2.
#      Both squads are mustered. The battle begins, and nobody is asked anything more.

#  14  turn 13, Squad One
run
#      The battle runs on.

#  15  turn 14, Squad One
beat
#      Round 1.
#      Squad One's rider at f3 strikes Squad Two's footman at f1 for 3, and leaves it 7.
#      Squad One's rider at f3 strikes Squad Two's footman at f3 for 3, and leaves it 7.
#      Squad One's rider at f3 strikes Squad Two's footman at f1 for 3, and leaves it 4.

#  16  turn 15, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's rider at m2 strikes Squad One's warder at f1 for 3, and leaves it 11.

#  17  turn 16, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's bowman at b1 shoots for 2, and Squad One's warder at f1 steps in front of it and is left with 9.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b1 shoots for 2, and Squad One's warder at f1 steps in front of it and is left with 7.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b1 shoots for 2, and Squad One's warder at f1 steps in front of it and is left with 5.

#  18  turn 17, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's warder at f1 for 2, and leaves it 3.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's warder at f1 for 2, and leaves it 1.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's warder at f1 for 2, and leaves it nothing.
#      Squad One's warder at f1 falls.

#  19  turn 18, Squad One
beat
#      Squad One's spearman at m1 strikes Squad Two's footman at f3 for 3, and leaves it 4.
#      Squad One's spearman at m1 strikes Squad Two's footman at f1 for 3, and leaves it 1.

#  20  turn 19, Squad One
beat
#      Squad One's footman at b3 strikes Squad Two's footman at f3 for 1, and leaves it 3.

#  21  turn 20, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's footman at f1 strikes Squad One's rider at f3 for 3, and leaves it 9.
#      Squad Two's footman at f1 strikes Squad One's rider at f3 for 3, and leaves it 6.

#  22  turn 21, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's footman at f3 strikes Squad One's rider at f3 for 3, and leaves it 3.
#      Squad Two's footman at f3 strikes Squad One's rider at f3 for 3, and leaves it nothing.
#      Squad One's rider at f3 falls.

#  23  turn 22, Squad One
beat
#      Squad One's mender at m2 has nobody hurt on a hex it touches.

#  24  turn 23, Squad One
beat
#      Round 2.
#      Squad Two's rider at m2 strikes Squad One's spearman at m1 for 3, and leaves it 6.

#  25  turn 24, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's bowman at b1 shoots Squad One's spearman at m1 for 2, and leaves it 4.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b1 shoots Squad One's spearman at m1 for 2, and leaves it 2.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b1 shoots Squad One's spearman at m1 for 2, and leaves it nothing.
#      Squad One's spearman at m1 falls.

#  26  turn 25, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's mender at m2 for 2, and leaves it 4.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's mender at m2 for 2, and leaves it 2.
#      Squad Two's bowman at b3 shoots Squad One's mender at m2 for 2, and leaves it nothing.
#      Squad One's mender at m2 falls.

#  27  turn 26, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's footman at f1 strikes Squad One's footman at b3 for 3, and leaves it 7.
#      Squad Two's footman at f1 strikes Squad One's footman at b3 for 3, and leaves it 4.

#  28  turn 27, Squad One
beat
#      Squad Two's footman at f3 strikes Squad One's footman at b3 for 3, and leaves it 1.
#      Squad Two's footman at f3 strikes Squad One's footman at b3 for 3, and leaves it nothing.
#      Squad One's footman at b3 falls.
#      The game is over: Squad One is broken, and Squad Two holds the field.

